-11-08T01:08:00Z -->\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/comments/6715422087/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/comments/6734573883","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/issues/6536#issuecomment-6734573883","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6536","id":6734573883,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJWP4788AAAABkWlxOw","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-09T07:22:49Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T07:22:49Z","body":"## Triage validation (task 11217, repo-worker-code, 2026-11-09)\n\n**Verdict:** confirmed bug at current main, fix path scoped — route as `small_fix` follow-on. No blockers; fix can proceed immediately.\n\n**Verified at current main:**\n- `infra/dns/save.sh:50` still `sops -e \"$dir/terraform.tfstate\" >\"$dir/terraform.tfstate.enc\"` — shell truncates `.enc` before sops runs; `set -Eexuo pipefail` (save.sh:2) exits after the truncation, nothing restores the previous ciphertext. Last touch of save.sh: `c4eebf0de0` (#1943 guard, plan-side only).\n- `infra/dns/load.sh:41` still `sops -d … > terraform.tfstate` (in-place). Assessed per the issue: plaintext target is re-derivable from the intact `.enc`, and `load.sh:34-37` / `init.sh:53-56` refuse missing/empty state — so a failed decrypt is recoverable by re-running load; documented as safe-by-reconstruction, optional hardening out of scope.\n- `init.sh` snapshot + sha256 verify + restore and `plan.sh` lineage check + `SKIP_SAVE` on refusal paths are present as described; they do not cover the `save.sh` encrypt-write itself, including plan.sh's EXIT-trap save after a successful plan.\n\n**Reproduction (verbatim `save.sh` from current main, stub `sops` on PATH):**\n- stub `-d` returns differing content (fast path skipped), stub `-e` exits 1 → `save.sh` exits 1 and `terraform.tfstate.enc` goes 28B → **0B**.\n- control (stub `-e` succeeds) → exit 0, new ciphertext in place.\n- already-current fast path (decrypt equals plaintext) → skips re-encryption, `.enc` byte-identical (`KEEP-ME` preserved).\n\n**Fix scope for follow-on (effort small):**\n- `save.sh:50`: encrypt to a same-directory temp file (`mktemp \"$dir/.terraform.tfstate.enc.XXXXXX\"`), on `sops` exit 0 + temp non-empty (plus optional decrypt-and-lineage check on the temp mirroring `plan.sh:87-93`) `mv` atomically over `.enc`; trap-cleanup temp on failure without touching live `.enc`; `.lock` behavior unchanged.\n- Regression probe: failing `sops -e` stub → `.enc` unchanged + non-zero exit; succeeding stub → new ciphertext; fast path still skips.\n- Out of scope: `load.sh:41` hardening (recorded safe-by-reconstruction above); #6554 (talos sibling, worse: no `set -e`, exits 0) stays a separate fix.\n\n**Ordering:** none — no blockers, no dependency on #6554 (sibling script, separate state of record).\n","autho