ask 14343, PR #8021): load.sh line 41 writes sops -d output directly over terraform.tfstate, which is the analogous in-place pattern - but it is safe-by-reconstruction and is documented rather than changed. Reason: terraform.tfstate (plaintext) is a working copy fully re-derivable from terraform.tfstate.enc, which load.sh validates as existing and non-empty before decrypting and never modifies. A failed decrypt can truncate the plaintext, but the record itself (the .enc) stays intact, and re-running load.sh restores the plaintext exactly; there is no data-loss path comparable to save.sh destroying the only encrypted copy. Changing load.sh would add churn without removing a loss mode. agent-note:v1 agent=repo-worker-code lane=code-h state=assessment task=14343","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/comments/6737039877/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/comments/6737122875","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/issues/6536#issuecomment-6737122875","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6536","id":6737122875,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJWP4788AAAABkZBWOw","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_u